            42535022
          ],
          "sectionId": 42535
        },
        {
          "bundle": "thetis",
          "rowIds": [
            42536001,
            42536002,
            42536003,
            42536004,
            42536005
          ],
          "sectionId": 42536
        }
      ],
      "title": "真相暗涌·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "42537001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "我们做到了，西蒂斯，真是太不可思议了~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "现在该怎么办，要把他们两个带到管理局去吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "别急，我们还有时间，索性先审审他们好了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537004",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "残破的芯片制造工坊内——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "快说，指使你们制造这么多芯片的幕后金主是谁？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "那些造出的芯片都被送到了哪里？使用途径又是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "金刚1号驾驶员",
          "text": "呵呵……哈哈哈哈……想知道吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "金刚1号驾驶员",
          "text": "靠近点，再近点，我全都告诉你们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "等等，他们身上有异常的红灯闪烁！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "不好，这是自爆程序的启动信号！快闪开！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "金刚2号驾驶员",
          "text": "想知道答案？和我一起下地狱吧！！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "西蒂斯，危险！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537013",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "砰————！！！！！！",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "咳咳，你、你还好吧？有没有哪里受伤？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "……为什么不顾自己的安危冲上来救我，你疯了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "嘿嘿，你看我这不是没事吗？\n我是未来的大冒险家，身上可是有好运光环的~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "薇薇安",
          "text": "真没想到这些家伙会选择自爆……他们这是不惜牺牲自己也要隐藏真相啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "42537018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "西蒂斯",
          "text": "走吧，我们还有最后一件工作要做。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-1085",
      "sourceRefs": [
        {
          "bundle": "thetis",
          "rowIds": [
            42537001,
            42537002,
            42537003,
            42537004,
            42537005,
            42537006,
            42537007,
            42537008,
